	(text_box "SONAR V1 POWER TREE (T-012, D002/D011)\n\n5V = USB-C VBUS (900 mA budget) or XT60 bench input, ideal-diode mux (power_mux sheet) -> VMUX / global 5V.\n+3.3V (3V3_D): AP63301 buck from 5V, 500 mA allocation. Consumers: digital sheet (+3.3V), 3V3_MIC branch, LEDs.\n3V3_MIC: +3.3V via FB2 (fit 0R; 120R @ 100MHz option), >=100 mA allocation (T-008). Consumers (T-010): 24x PDM mics + CDCLVC1112 clock tree.\n+12V: TPS55340 boost from 5V, 350 mA spec (~4 W). Consumer: DRV8876 TX bridge (T-013). TX bursts exceed the USB-C budget - use XT60 for TX work.\nSequencing: 3V3_D starts with 5V (EN pulled up to Vin); the 12V boost EN is pulled up to +3.3V, so the TX rail rises only after 3V3_D is up.\nRail details + bring-up measurements: orchestration/rails.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(size 150 48)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "70db0306-9cd7-4b06-8ea0-52ce687e9fa2")
	)
	(text_box "3V3_D buck: AP63301WU-7 (3.8-32 V in, 3 A, 500 kHz, VFB = 0.8 V).\nVout = 0.8 * (1 + 31.6k/10k) = 3.33 V.\nL = 2.2 uH (PNR252012-2R2M, 2.15 A rated / 3 A sat).\nCin 10uF + 100nF, Cout 2x22uF, BST 100nF.\nEN pulled to Vin via 100k -> starts with the 5V rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 95.25 120 0)
		(size 72 16)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e858b493-869e-4ce5-8e5b-92e5019d76d9")
	)
	(text_box "FB2 mic-rail filter (T-008): fit 0R 0603 initially so the rail is\nobservable; 120R @ 100MHz ferrite (BLM18KG121TN1D) is the\nreviewed upgrade option. 10uF + 1uF low-ESR bulk at rail entry.\n3V3_MIC allocation >=100 mA (24 mics + CDCLVC1112, see\ndocs/pdm-rx-design.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 120 0)
		(size 72 14)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "256db86f-7157-482d-a2bf-f85d065d61b5")
	)
